; values they stand for: of a book of w by w, x by w and y, x and y each
; 0 to w - 1. The 15 books of the big values, those of the tables 1, 2,
; 3, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 15, 16 and 24, the books of 16 to 31
; the last two with more bits; then the two of the count1 quads, by
; their 4 bits v w x y. Then half the synthesis window. Generated from
; the tables of the standard, each book checked complete. Lists, so
; globals and not + constants.
